  "instructions_for_implementation": [
    "Ensure all components use standard .js extension with React hooks.",
    "Import Lucide-React icons (Sparkles, Sun, Trees, Snowflake, Phone, Mail, MapPin, CheckCircle2, ShieldCheck, Clock, MessageSquare, Lock, X, Send).",
    "Use Tailwind CSS for styling with generous spacing (p-6, p-8, p-12).",
    "Include floating chatbot widget persistently on public pages.",
    "Add interactive admin login form and table for viewing contact submissions with localStorage fallback storage.",
    "Add toast notifications via Sonner when contact forms are submitted.",
    "Ensure all data-testid attributes specified are attached to their respective UI elements."
  ]
